	(text "Every signal into the module is 3.3 V.\nThe module's own 3.3 V output is not used: the board makes its own +3V3A and +3V3D.\nPico 2: 5 V reaches VSYS through D203 (Schottky, net MOD_5V), VBUS is left to USB.\nESP32-P4-WIFI6 (Pico pinout): firmware must set LDO channel 4 to 3.3 V first (pins 21, 22, 24 are on that bank); bridge JP201 for its supply margin. See docs/analogue_board_esp32p4.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.6 1.6))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccdb7d3e-0659-51ca-b67d-a929097d5d69")
	)
